      "V패킹 VF형 | ILJIN 베어링": "V-Packing VF Type | ILJIN Bearing",
      "<p class=\"eyebrow\">V-Packing VF Type</p> <h2>V패킹 VF형</h2> <p>피스톤·로드 겸용으로 사용하는 <strong style=\"color: var(--accent);\">V-패킹 VF형</strong>입니다. 이 시리즈는 별도 형번 없이 외경(D)·내경(d) 조합으로 규격을 구분합니다.</p>": "<p class=\"eyebrow\">V-Packing VF Type</p> <h2>V-Packing VF Type</h2> <p>The <strong style=\"color: var(--accent);\">V-Packing VF type</strong>, used for both piston and rod applications. This series has no separate model numbers and is distinguished by its combination of outer diameter (D) and bore (d).</p>",
      "<img src=\"assets/v_packing_vf_diagram.png\" alt=\"V-Packing VF형 도면\" style=\"height: 220px; width: auto; max-width: 100%; object-fit: contain;\"> <p class=\"diagram-legend\">↑ 단면도 (90° V자형)<br><span style=\"color: var(--text-faint);\">d=내경 · D=외경 · r=모서리</span></p>": "<img src=\"assets/v_packing_vf_diagram.png\" alt=\"V-Packing VF type drawing\" style=\"height: 220px; width: auto; max-width: 100%; object-fit: contain;\"> <p class=\"diagram-legend\">↑ Cross-Section (90° V-shape)<br><span style=\"color: var(--text-faint);\">d=Bore · D=Outer Diameter · r=Corner Radius</span></p>",
      "계속 (D 180 이상)": "Continued (D 180 and above)",
      "단위: mm · D=외경 · d=내경": "Unit: mm · D=Outer Diameter · d=Bore"
    },
