      "<img src=\"assets/v_packing_vf_diagram.png\" alt=\"V-Packing VF형 도면\" style=\"height: 220px; width: auto; max-width: 100%; object-fit: contain;\"> <p class=\"diagram-legend\">↑ 단면도 (90° V자형)<br><span style=\"color: var(--text-faint);\">d=내경 · D=외경 · r=모서리</span></p>": "<img src=\"assets/v_packing_vf_diagram.png\" alt=\"V形パッキンVF形 図面\" style=\"height: 220px; width: auto; max-width: 100%; object-fit: contain;\"> <p class=\"diagram-legend\">↑ 断面図(90°V字形)<br><span style=\"color: var(--text-faint);\">d=内径 ・ D=外径 ・ r=角部半径</span></p>",
